description=Build and pair four-facing portals in single-player. Four reusable original car-battery slots store up to four full-battery equivalents. Trip energy is configurable from 0.5 to 4, default 2, paid entirely at departure. Installed batteries recharge only while the portal is loaded and locally powered. The arrival portal needs neither batteries nor electricity. Includes resizable compact management with power/source/charging status and optional Viewpoint models. No item-giver feature. New construction requires a premium camera, a handheld walkie-talkie, Electrical 4 and Welding 3, with retained welding tools. Pure Lua; gameplay acceptance is pending and vehicle or multiplayer transport is not included.
descriptionzh=可建造、命名并一对一配对的四朝向单人传送门。四个原版汽车电池槽可反复充电，总容量为四块满电电池等量。沙盒可设单次耗电0.5至4，默认2，全部由起点提供。已安装电池只在门已加载且当地有电时充电；终点无需电池或供电。附可缩放紧凑管理界面、电源及充电提示和可选Viewpoint模型，无领取道具功能。新配方需高端相机、手持对讲机、电工4级和焊接3级，保留焊接工具。采用纯Lua，游戏内验收待完成；暂不支持车辆或联机传送。
